Below is a list of all files modified and the output of the program. 
The program works almost all the time but sometime because of my computer I think, I have to re run it but it will
always work the second time at least. All values seem accurate. 

proc.c/proc.h:
Added CFS scheduler implementation with vruntime tracking, nice values, and process weight calculations. Modified process struct to support CFS.

syscall.c/syscall.h:
Added new system calls for CFS (nice(), startcfs(), stopcfs(), getruntime()) and updated syscall table.

sysproc.c:
Minor adjustment for new scheduler system calls.

user/testsyscall-2.c:
Added test program to verify CFS scheduler behavior.

user.h/usys.pl:
Added calls to user

Key changes: Implemented Completely Fair Scheduler (CFS) with vruntime-based process selection and configurable scheduling parameters.

